  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\nGiven equation: 12 + 156 ÷ 13 × 6 - 100 = 50\n\n**1) ÷ and -**\n\nAfter interchanging the sign,\n\nWe get: 12 + 156 - 13 × __**6 ÷ 100 **__= 50\n\n⇒ 12 + 156 - __**13 × 0.06**__ = 50\n\n⇒ __**12 + 156**__ - 0.78 = 50\n\n⇒ __**168 - 0.78**__ = 50\n\n⇒ **167.22 ≠ 50**\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) + and ×**\n\nAfter interchanging the sign,\n\nWe get: 12 × __**156 ÷ 13**__ + 6 - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ __**12 × 12**__ + 6 - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ __**144 + 6**__ - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ __**150 - 100**__ = 50\n\n⇒ **50 = 50 **\n\n⇒** LHS = RHS**\n\n**3) - and ×**\n\nAfter interchanging the sign,\n\nWe get: 12 + __**156 ÷ 13**__ - 6 × 100 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 + 12 - __**6 × 100 **__= 50\n\n⇒ __**12 + 12**__ - 600 = 50\n\n⇒ __**24 - 600**__ = 50\n\n⇒ -576 ≠ 50\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**4) ÷ and × **\n\nAfter interchanging the sign,\n\nWe get: 12 + 156 × __**13 ÷ 6**__ - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 + __**156 × 2.1666**__ - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ __**12 + 338**__ - 100 = 50\n\n⇒ __**350 - 100**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 250 ≠ 50\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
